<title>UK: BPI Capital Finance sets $100 mln step-up FRN,call.</title>
<headline>BPI Capital Finance sets $100 mln step-up FRN,call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BPI CAPITAL FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BPI-SGPS</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     *115 BP   PAY DATE    19.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA2	ISS PRICE  100.0     FULL FEES   1.0</p>
<p> NOTES	*CALL AT PAR FROM DEC 2001 IF NOT CALLED THEN STEPS</p>
<p>		 UP TO 265 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS ($) 25	SALE LIMITS US/UK/PT/KY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    **	  MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC   0.50</p>
<p> NOTES	**CAYMAN ISLANDS AND ENGLISH</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
